\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30005555 (OWR-13750338-003). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Machine Learning for Science: Mathematics at the Interface of Data-driven and Mechanistic Modelling (2023), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2023/26, pp. 1453--1484. Original report and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2023/26}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30005555}

